    ('SA', 'Saudi Arabia', 'sa|sau|ksa|saudi|saudi arabia|kingdom of saudi arabia|riyadh|jeddah|dammam|khobar|mecca|makkah|medina|madinah|السعودية|المملكة العربية السعودية|الرياض|جدة',
     'Istimara (vehicle registration)', 'General Department of Traffic (Muroor) via Absher; Transport General Authority for commercial transport',
